  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"441\" height=\"129\"></a></strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新 Discord 服务器！提供私人支持和更新提醒。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>创造：掠夺者崛起（结构）</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">通过引入</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>机械化掠夺者堡垒</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">和</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工程前哨站</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">来增强你的 Minecraft</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">世界，将</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create 模组</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">的创造力与掠夺者的致命机智相结合。这些新结构并非普通的掠夺者前哨站——这些基地配备了复杂的机械装置、自动化防御设施和巧妙的陷阱，即使是经验丰富的冒险者也将面临严峻的挑战。</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">别忘了在我的个人资料中查看我的其他模组！</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">此模组现由 Mei_Xiao_gong（首席开发者）拥有</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/977/pill.png\" alt=\"pill\" width=\"230\" height=\"230\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/978/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"231\" height=\"231\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">下载 Create 模组：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">想要更具挑战性的战斗吗？下载：</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠夺者之枪</a></span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/28/pillagers-spawned-on-my-base-v0-qg3r7317xebb1.webp\" alt=\"pillager\" width=\"580\" height=\"461\"></span></span></p>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/805/create-mod-minecraft.jpg\" alt=\"create mod\" width=\"1200\" height=\"640\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">做好准备</span>，迎接战略突袭，你的战斗技巧和机制理解能力都将受到考验！</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>丰厚的战利品</strong></span>：成功突袭这些加固基地，寻找稀有战利品，包括 Create 模组的材料、蓝图和组件，你可以利用它们来增强自己的建筑。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/995/steam_engine.webp\" alt=\"steam\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1057/896/minecraft__1.png\" alt=\"catahrdral\" width=\"2158\" height=\"1091\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">工作原理：</span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>探索世界</strong>： </span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">在世界各处随机发现这些升级版的掠夺者结构，从简单的机械化前哨站到宏伟复杂的堡垒应有尽有。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">安装方法：</span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>安装 Create 模组</strong></span>： <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">本模组需要</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create 模组</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，请确保已正确安装并运行。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>下载 Pillager Arise (Structures)</strong></span>： <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">将模组文件放入 <code>.minecraft/mods</code> 文件夹中。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>启动 Minecraft</strong>： </span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">启动游戏，尽情探索这些复杂的全新掠夺者堡垒和前哨站吧！</span></h1>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/324/kagud6s.png\" alt=\"forge\" width=\"164\" height=\"164\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">仅限 Forge 版：</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.19.2</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.20.1</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/904/291/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组使用 IntelliJ 开发：</span></h1>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h1>免责声明：本产品不是官方 Minecraft 产品。未经 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准或认可。</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
